@api = http://localhost:5080
@provider = http://localhost:5081

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### Catalog cache
GET {{api}}/api/products/recarga-vivo-30

### Catalog filter
GET {{api}}/api/products?type=GiftCard&provider=PSN

### Create payment (repeat without changing the key to demonstrate replay)
POST {{api}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-001

{"productId":"recarga-vivo-30","phoneNumber":"11999999999","scenario":"Success"}

### Timeout after external effect
POST {{api}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-timeout-001

{"productId":"recarga-vivo-30","phoneNumber":"11999999999","scenario":"TimeoutAfterEffect"}

### List payments
GET {{api}}/api/payments

### Diagnostics
GET {{api}}/api/diagnostics

### External operation evidence
GET {{provider}}/provider/operations
